    {
      "text": "The cover of a publication titled \"National AIDS Programmes: A guide to indicators for monitoring and evaluating national HIV/AIDS prevention programmes for young people,\" showing the title text on a red ribbon-patterned background with logos of UNAIDS, UNICEF, WHO and other partner organizations along the bottom.",
